{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騰訊音樂第二季多賺百分之2.5，純利有24.7億元人民幣。經調整純利26.8億元人民幣，按年增長百分之4.3。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入89.3億元人民幣，上升百分之5.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T23:59:54.656116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}